e summary table.\n- share_savings_balance: the Balance cell of the accounts-table row whose Description is \"Share Savings\" (suffix 00). Do NOT take the first data row blindly — account ordering/suffixes can vary; match on the \"Share Savings\" description. Other rows such as \"Share Draft Checking\" must be ignored.\n\nThis run: member «inputs.member_id» -> «member_name», «share_savings_balance».\n\nInterstitials expected on other runs: system_notice (dismiss), service_unavailable (retry), session_expired / signed_out (cannot be self-handled — no credentials may be entered; escalate). member_alert is deliberately NOT auto-dismissed and requires request_help before continuing to member_detail.\n\nThe member_detail screen also offers \"Open Sub-Account\" (leading to subacct_form / subacct_review / subacct_opened / subacct_invalid). Those states are out of scope for this read-only lookup and were not exercised; never click that link during replay."}}]}}
